WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.840
Kerkez wins the header.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.800
And that's played through beautifully,
and Liverpool have been opened up...

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.240
And the chance is blazed over the top,
and what a great chance it was.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.800
Araujo, on towards Wirtz.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:30.320
Araujo wins the ball,
and he's still got it.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.240
And it's in!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.400
It got a big deflection on the way through, but
it's yet another Anfield goal for Florian Wirtz.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.600
Alisson's ball downfield.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.960
Had to go downfield because
there was a slip by Jacquet,

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:58.200
but it might turn into something for Liverpool!

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.200
Barcola...

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.200
Isak!

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.720
2-0.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.520
Just like that.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.360
One little break, one little moment,
and Alexander Isak loves a goal.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.880
Goodness me, Alexis Mac Allister
had to be sharp there.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.200
Liverpool still haven't managed
to get the ball away.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.640
And the shot - with Alisson beaten -
comes back off the woodwork.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:31.680
Liverpool get themselves out of a situation
of their own making.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.120
That's a clever ball by Wirtz.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.360
This is Mac Allister.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.840
And Ronald Araujo has
plenty of time and space...

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.040
Oh, and Verbruggen with a really good save.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.040
Araujo fully extended him.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.880
That's nice, Gravenberch.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.960
Here's Cody Gakpo, Koumas makes the run...

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.040
Gakpo went for goal.

